    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是关于生命力、感受力、欲望、inner peace的分享与讨论。</span></p><p><span>在本期节目中你可以收听到：</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>「whywhywhy」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 谁打开了我的省电模式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 做完了，然后呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 谁对我使了葵花点穴手</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>「yesyesyes」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 返璞归真</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a> 在不确定的日子里拥抱熟悉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 引入新变量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a> 我们都只是伦敦塔桥事件里的宁静</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>「nonono」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 被压制的欲望成了黑洞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 不航行的船当然是安全的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a> 哎呀，摔倒了呢</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><p><span>Something About Us — Daft Punk</span></p><p><span>because, — Crayon Case</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>Collaboration:</span></strong></p><p><span>主播：福宝、小腊子、Hippo</span></p><p><span>剪辑：福宝、Hippo、小腊子</span></p><p><span>BGM: Hippo</span></p><p><span>Shownotes: 小腊子&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
