    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是关于自我介绍、标签化、对自我的觉察和了解的分享与讨论。</span></p><p><span>在本期节目中你可以收听到：</span></p><p></p><p><span>「我也不太了解我自己」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a> 标签化的求同存异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 量化自己的感知&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> 就陷进柔软里吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 一点一点地了解</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>「我清楚地看见你」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 如果有人形外星人存在的话 我会怀疑那个人是她</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> 她的耳机里一定有你没听过 却会被深深吸引的歌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 在与世界斡旋这一项 她一定能拿到高分</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2045">34:05</a> BE VALIDATED and RECOGNIZED</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2Tl5MS3WyQUUv-aiPx03t9fZKx.png"><p></p><p><span>BGM：</span></p><p><span>Humoresque/A.Dvorzak - Sho UEMURA</span></p><p><span>Creep - Radiohead</span></p><p><span>Ribs - Lorde</span></p><p></p><p><span>Collaboration:</span></p><p><span>主播：福宝、小腊子、Hippo</span></p><p><span>剪辑：福宝、Hippo、小腊子</span></p><p><span>BGM: Hippo</span></p><p><span>Shownotes: 小腊子&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
