    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你也经常说“随便”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是关于“随便”、表达意愿、决策、领导力的分享与讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中你可以收听到：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「🎆」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">02:53</a> 也是打上鸡血了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> 一刻就足够</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「❓」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> “随便” literally means 都可以吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a> 我的“随便”被利用了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> “随便”是一种权力让渡吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> “随便” 或许是盲盒代金券</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「❕」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">21:42</a> 请不要放弃表达自己的意愿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 集体主义下催生的口头禅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 深度对话的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Try - BROTHER SUN SISTER MOON</span></p><span></span><p><span>Psycho Killer - Talking Heads</span></p><span></span><p><span>brutal - Olivia Rodrigo</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Collaboration:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：福宝、小腊子、Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：福宝、Hippo、小腊子</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：小腊子</span></p>]]></description>
