  <item>
    <title>言语的边界，就是爱的边界吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b1b6bf5faf3686591081bc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b1b6bf5faf3686591081bc</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Sep 2025 16:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你是如何表达爱的呢？</span></p><p><span>本期节目是关于爱的五种语言的理解、习得、偏好、碰撞的分享与讨论。</span></p><p><span>爱的五种语言分别是：接收礼物、服务行为、肢体触摸、肯定的话语以及优质时间。</span></p><p><span>在本期节目中你可以收听到：</span></p><p><strong><span>「🌍」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> 请体验吧！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> 旅行中的十五分钟原则</span></p><p><strong><span>「Love Language」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 爱的五种语言</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> What is quality time?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a> 爱究竟该用你的语言还是我的语言来衡量？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2308">38:28</a> 爱的语言的差异会带来误解吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 典型东亚父母的爱的语言是——</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a> 或许爱的表达方式是可以引导的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2776">46:16</a> 在原生家庭中习得的爱的语言</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3174">52:54</a> 爱的语言互补的话…</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3294">54:54</a> 润物细无声的Acts of Service</span></p><p><strong><span>「💑」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 爱相似的人还是不同的人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 那就让我成为TA吧！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> 优秀的个人特质不代表好的伴侣特质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a> 亲密关系中的可控性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a> “爱是将你没有的东西献给一个根本不想要它的人”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3535">58:55</a> 爱的表达是感受还是责任？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3713">1:01:53</a> 爱的多语言者</span></p><p><strong><span>Love Language测试链接：</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://5lovelanguages.com/quizzes/love-language/" data-url="https://5lovelanguages.com/quizzes/love-language/"><span>5lovelanguages.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><p><span>Can it be so simple - EL Michels Affair</span></p><p><span>好感觉 - 戴佩妮</span></p><p><span>生活的答案 - 洪申豪</span></p><p><span>问题天天都多 - 欧倩怡</span></p><p><strong><span>Collaboration:</span></strong></p><p><span>主播：福宝、小腊子、Hippo</span></p><p><span>剪辑：福宝、Hippo、小腊子</span></p><p><span>BGM: Hippo</span></p><p><span>Shownotes：小腊子</span></p>]]></description>
