  <item>
    <title>被你看见之前，我先把自己藏好了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686c8b6560f8f77d4061e035</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686c8b6560f8f77d4061e035</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 03:13:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是关于好奇心、窥私欲、注意力经济、deep talk、自我披露的分享与讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中你可以收听到：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「🍟」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 你是居然派还是竟然派？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 有羊毛不薅天理难容（x</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a> 最好的塔罗师就是自己</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「Knock Knock」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a> 对人类的好奇心是我认识这个世界的Buff</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a> Hi 我可以共享一部分你的精神世界吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 你会好奇自己在对方心里的分量吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">29:43</a> 对他人的好奇心是我的选票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3192">53:12</a> 对&lt;小宇宙&gt;的解读</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「May I」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a> 这才是我的朋友圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a> 真正的放下是不再好奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 可惜的是 好奇心的降低让我与世界的联结变少了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> 关于注意力资源的合理分配</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「Bridge」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2654">44:14</a> What is deep talk?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3053">50:53</a> 真诚是一种态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3245">54:05</a> What is love?</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「👩‍🎤🧑‍🎤」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> Idol也需要捶枕头发泄情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2367">39:27</a> 爱一个人就要接受他的全部吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> 谁都有权利披露自我</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Love is A Song - DJ &nbsp;Soulscape</span></p><span></span><p><span>Should Have Known Better - Sufjan Stevens</span></p><span></span><p><span>If You Want Me To Stay - Sly &amp; The Family Stone</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Leanover- Life Without Buildings</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Collaboration:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：福宝、小腊子、Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：福宝、Hippo、小腊子</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：小腊子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66cf01a44577e1ffae698bd7/lmBKRRY3D6TM7xRfFdsRFKJMZ_w5.m4a" length="59312196" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkr0P_MuwBVJh0-LpH4kv6nNvOx9.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
