  <item>
    <title>总有一些味道，比对话更能安慰人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68221f2224f855934641b2d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68221f2224f855934641b2d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 May 2025 16:24:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是关于情绪性进食、暴食、食物与回忆的关系、comfort food、“美德肥”、美食的“名人效应”、食物是情感载体的分享与讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中你可以收听到：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「咔滋咔滋」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 🙇‍♀️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a> 和大盗相约欧洲游Day 1 （x</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">06:18</a> 开启自动跟随的东京游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> Culture shock之冷夹生饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> 用Salt传递对美食的Love</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a> 麦当劳理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">39:23</a> 喜欢就是想要投喂对方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3696">1:01:36</a> 名正言顺的发呆时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3911">1:05:11</a> 味觉敏感度 pls come back to me</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4482">1:14:42</a> 美德肥 pls leave me alone</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「咂巴咂巴」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 食物白月光的回忆buff</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">15:51</a> 那份独一无二的味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">48:52</a> 美食体验重要程度排序：口味，服务，环境，同伴，餐厅评分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3444">57:24</a> 酵母养成计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3565">59:25</a> 童年的羁绊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「吧唧吧唧」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 这一次 我要夺回我对人生的掌控权 就决定是你了 自助餐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 番茄炒蛋你吃咸口还是甜口？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 吃播——我的赛博夜宵</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「吸溜吸溜」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1336">22:16</a> 情绪性进食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> 《你的抑郁，90%可以靠食物改善》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2117">35:17</a> 小川糸让我感受到食物所承载的情感重量</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>中华冷面 （伴奏版）- 邓丽欣</span></p><span></span><p><span>蛋炒饭 - 庾澄庆</span></p><span></span><p><span>分分钟需要你 - 林忆莲</span></p><span></span><p><span>身体发肤 - 谢安琪</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：福宝、小腊子、Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：福宝、Hippo、小腊子</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：小腊子</span></p>]]></description>
