  <item>
    <title>我试过打开你，但后来决定先读懂我自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fd214bcdd692da15462743</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fd214bcdd692da15462743</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 19:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是关于一个人、孤独感、“搭子文化”、人际交往、感同身受的分享与讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中你可以收听到：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「我是我的好homie」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 我给自己过生日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 我一个人吃饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a> 我一个人逛街、看展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3709">01:01:49</a> Vlogger让我开始憧憬独居生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2225">37:05</a> 世界上没有真正的感同身受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a> 只有自己不会为难自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2568">42:48</a> 不用期望被选择，也不会害怕被抛弃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 测测“关于孤独的十五个等级”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「Actually…」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 生日也只是充实的又一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> 我比自己想象的要厉害得多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3017">50:17</a> 长大就是接受了关系的流动性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 放低期待，保持耐心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> Nobody cares about you</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2866">47:46</a> 只有快乐是真的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a>找“搭子”比找“朋友”轻松多了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">33:56</a> 每个人都是一座孤岛，幸好有爱可以筑起跨海大桥</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Hard to say- 我是機車少女</span></p><span></span><p><span>讽刺- 何欣穗</span></p><span></span><p><span>80%完美的日子 - 陈绮贞</span></p><span></span><p><span>桃- The Cheers Cheers</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wui - 陈娴静</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：福宝、小腊子、Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：福宝、Hippo、小腊子</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：小腊子</span></p>]]></description>
