    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cf233be924d4525aaf9168</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cf233be924d4525aaf9168</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 18:49:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是关于电影《还有明天》的分享与讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中你可以收听到：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「🎬 」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 你有多久没看过黑白电影了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> 一个巴掌奠定了电影基调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="873">14:33</a> 不是情书，而是选票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2228">37:08</a> 还有明天</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「🤔」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a> 如何看待家暴歌舞化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 暴力狂究竟是巧合还是以小见大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a> 涂上又擦去的口红</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 明天会是什么样子的？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「💭」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 沉默不等于妥协</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> 人生中片刻的逃离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> 哪怕是以再也不能见面为代价，我也支持你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> 以爱情为饵的婚姻骗局</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Nella città - Lele Marchitelli</span></p><span></span><p><span>Calvin - The Jon Spencer Blues Explosion</span></p><span></span><p><span>La Llorrona - DeVotchKa</span></p><span></span><p><span>A bocca chiusa - Daniele Silvestri</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：福宝、小腊子、Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：福宝、Hippo、小腊子</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Hippo</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：小腊子</span></p>]]></description>
